# Compiler and/or linker options can be added here to add to (or override) those
# added automatically by Kitsune for the 'cuda' tapir target. 
#
# Other options can be added here as well, but any options not exclusively
# intended for the 'cuda' tapir target should be added to the frontend config
# files (${KITSUNE_C_FRONTEND}.cfg, ${KITSUNE_CXX_FRONTEND}.cfg, ${KITSUNE_Fortran_FRONTEND}.cfg).
#
# See clang's documentation for details on the config files.
#
# FIXME: We probably don't want these set by default. We should check if Kitsune
# relies on this. If it does, this should probably be passed on to the backend
# in some other way.
#
-mllvm -stripmine-count=1
-mllvm -stripmine-coarsen-factor=1
